-- Per-benchmark CodSpeed measurement for tasty-bench. Pinned to a commit rather
-- than a branch: the measured numbers are only comparable against a CodSpeed
-- baseline produced by the same harness, so this moving underfoot would
-- invalidate the history without anything failing.
